[a] You have to select the Language version (1.8 versus 1.7) in a few places

File --> Settings --> Build, Execution, Deployment --> Java Compiler.

There you will need to change the "Target bytecode version" to 1.8 or whatever you need for the module in question.
This is to keep Intellij's compiler happy


[b] In addition goto Project Settings (not general settings like above)

Under modules : Select language level

Under Project : Select SDK and language level
